    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 2 — Probability Overlay.</strong> Reroll the lowest die on any manifestation roll — yours — once per round. (This is the Tikkun Identification bonus refracted through the universal manifestation system: same arithmetic, same once-per-round cadence, applied wherever dice are read for manifestation.)</p>\n<p style=\"opacity:0.7;font-size:0.85em\">Discipline (passive): Misfire shift −1 (stacks with Tier 1 to total −2).</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"wlT2\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Probability Overlay</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/round &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Free (after roll) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Reroll the lowest die on any manifestation roll — yours.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
